# ephemeral worker knowledge scratch — gossiped-tier perceptions (capability sweeps, smoke-gap
# audits, verify-rotation logs), NOT durable design docs. They churn fast and pollute git status /
# risk accidental commits. Durable docs (INDEX, runbooks, *-verdict, capability-sweep-*) stay tracked.
knowledge/capability-gaps-*
knowledge/smoke-gap-*
knowledge/verify-rotation-*
knowledge/doc-drift-*
